+| An edit to `claude/.claude/settings.json`, or `stow` (Self-Modification) | Outside this pass. A task that seems to need one is a stop. |
+| A compound command the classifier refused with no reason, or while it was unavailable | Re-issue the same work as single commands, each run from the worktree with no `cd` and no pipe. |
+| `git push origin HEAD:main` (unexplained classifier) | Push only the pass branch: `git push -u origin ur-w2`, as its own command. Never push to `main`. |
